r China, where iPhone revenue represented a moderately higher proportion of net sales.\n\nAs of September 27, 2025 and September 28, 2024, the Company had total deferred revenue of $13.7 billion and $12.8 billion, respectively. As of September 27, 2025, the Company expects 66% of total deferred revenue to be realized in less than a year, 23% within one-to-two years, 9% within two-to-three years and 2% in greater than three years."},"doc":{"aliases":[],"company":"Apple","filing_date":"2025-10-31","fy":2025,"ticker":"AAPL","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019325000079/aapl-20250927.htm"}},{"candidate":{"chunk_id":"AAPL-FY2025-structure-00077","doc_id":"AAPL-FY2025","lexical":{"rank":14,"score":12.343044494407343},"dense":{"rank":1,"score":0.7884783154253152},"fused":{"rank":5,"score":0.029906956136464335},"rerank":null},"chunk":{"char_end":88691,"char_start":88540,"doc_id":"AAPL-FY2025","heading_path":["Item 7 Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations","Segment Operating Performance","Greater China"],"item":"7","text":"Greater China net sales decreased during 2025 compared to 2024 primarily due to lower net sales of iPhone, partially offset by higher net sales of Mac."},"doc":{"aliases":[],"company":"Apple","filing_date":"2025-10-31","fy":2025,"ticker":"AAPL","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019325000079/aapl-20250927.htm"}},{"candidate":{"chunk_id":"AAPL-FY2025-structure-00080","doc_id":"AAPL-FY2025","lexical":{"rank":12,"score":12.618351508332772},"dense":{"rank":3,"score":0.7589903170765359},"fused":{"rank":6,"score":0.02976190476190476},"rerank":null},"chunk":{"char_end":89559,"char_start":89011,"doc_id":"AAPL-FY2025","heading_path":["Item 7 Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations","Products and Services Performance"],"item":"7","text":"The following table shows net sales by category for 2025, 2024 and 2023 (dollars in mil